belegt-dictionary — licensing
==============================

This package contains two kinds of material under two licenses (02 §6.1, 09 §1.2):

1. DATA — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
   Everything under src/belegt_dictionary/data/ (DataPoint definitions, TemplateMapping
   files, units and conversion tables, enums, aliases, reference lists, JSON Schemas,
   migration notes) and rfcs/.
   Full text: LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
   Attribution: "Belegt Data Point Dictionary (belegt-dictionary), © Belegt dictionary
   contributors, licensed under CC BY 4.0".

   TemplateMapping files contain only locators (question numbers, cells, field names) and
   short labels written by the contributors. They do not reproduce questionnaire or
   regulation text; official sources remain subject to their own terms.

2. CODE — Apache License, Version 2.0
   Everything under src/belegt_dictionary/ except data/ (loader, models, unit conversion,
   period alignment, validator `belegt-dict`), tests/ and pyproject.toml.
   Full text: LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt — https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

SPDX: data `CC-BY-4.0`, code `Apache-2.0`.
